# fixture: parentless exons, Zea mays B73 chloroplast NC_001666.2, verbatim.
# The second exon block of a trans-spliced chloroplast gene whose first exon
# lies elsewhere. NCBI's converter could not express the link, so it emitted
# them with coordinate-derived IDs and no Parent. All three carry number=2.
# Two such exons exist in the whole 1.2 M-feature annotation, both organellar.
# GFF3 permits a top-level feature of any type, so these load as top-level
# rather than being refused (D-069). graph-closed.
